  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "One session",
      "items": [
        "Ex-date dividends hit prior-close holders; the impure slice leaves cash.",
        "Yesterday's orders fill at today's open: sells, then buys, cost in basis points.",
        "At the close the engine screens, scores, weights, and scales by SMA exposure.",
        "New orders wait for the next open. The first session fills at that close.",
        "Layers do not call each other. The simulator is the only caller."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "What is official",
      "items": [
        "NAV is ledgers/<book>/<hash>/nav.parquet, marked from fills.",
        "Git keeps spec.yaml, manifest.json, nav.parquet, diagnostics.json, plus ops/state nav.csv and account.json.",
        "Positions, orders, fills, cashflows, and events stay on R2.",
        "A confirmed overlay changes the spec hash and starts a new ledger folder."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Left off this map",
      "items": [
        "Research notebooks are not drawn. They call this same simulator; they are not a second engine.",
        "universe.py members() is not on the daily path. Membership is inside screen() via ResearchData.halal.",
        "ops run --targets-only is the older sleeve session, local paper or Alpaca. The default session does not use it.",
        "No custodian, subscriptions, or charity wire. Purification is a paper cashflow."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
